  "question": {
    "text": "A square loop of side $15 \\mathrm{~cm}$ being moved towards right at a constant speed of 2 $\\mathrm{cm} / \\mathrm{s}$ as shown in figure. The front edge enters the $50 \\mathrm{~cm}$ wide magnetic field at $t=$ 0 . The value of induced emf in the loop at $t=10 \\mathrm{~s}$ will be :\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Xgs8Q8Qun4rlgV327RmadPvLXnHTCpiLCQjSDvyshEk.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
